+- [x] 1.2 Add `OrderRepository.applyCoupon(id, couponCode, discountCents, finalAmountCents)` that updates the order; verify with `npm run build`.
+
+## 2. Coupon application service
+
+- [x] 2.1 Inject `CouponRepository` into `OrderService` and wire it in `src/app.ts`; verify `npm run build` passes.
+- [x] 2.2 Implement `OrderService.applyCoupon(orderId, couponCode)` with order/coupon lookup, `ACTIVE` + window + usage-limit + minimum-amount validation, returning 404 for a missing order and 400 for invalid coupons; verify with tests in task 3.
+- [x] 2.3 Implement discount math (FIXED subtract, PERCENT rounded, `maxDiscountCents` cap, clamp to amount) and persist the order plus redemption in a transaction; verify with tests in task 3.
+
+## 3. Route and tests
+
+- [x] 3.1 Register `POST /orders/:id/apply-coupon` in `src/routes/orders.ts` returning 200 with the updated order; verify with `npm run build`.
+- [x] 3.2 Add `tests/apply-coupon.test.ts` covering valid FIXED and PERCENT (200 + amounts), unknown/disabled/expired/not-yet-valid coupons (400), order below minimum (400), non-pending order (400), unknown order (404) and redemption/used-count increment; verify with `npm test`.
+
+## 4. Integration check
+
+- [x] 4.1 Run `npm run build` and `npm test` together and confirm the full suite passes without modifying `TASK.md` or existing tests.
+
+## Workflow follow-up
